  "status": "generic_settlement_allocation_identity_adopted_full_event_journals_pending_not_implemented",
  "scope": "尚无专用结算ID算法的正式业务事件统一身份预留；不更改已采用trade_id=settlement_id、session begin、buyback-close等具名ID。完整事件根及pending/result owner记录仍待。",
